# Mangaka Days, Indonesian (i18n, 2026-10-10).
# msgid is the English text exactly as the game shows it; anything missing here stays in English.
# Draft translations: a native speaker still needs to check them.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: id\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"

msgid "Language"
msgstr "Bahasa"

msgid "Automatic, follows Windows"
msgstr "Otomatis, mengikuti Windows"

msgid "Helper-Chan's voice"
msgstr "Suara Helper-Chan"

msgid "English"
msgstr "Inggris"

msgid "Japanese"
msgstr "Jepang"

msgid "Off, text only"
msgstr "Mati, teks saja"

msgid "Read later"
msgstr "Baca nanti"

msgid "Skip this conversation"
msgstr "Lewati percakapan ini"

msgid "A place beside yours"
msgstr "Tempat di sampingmu"

msgid "The desk is ready. So am I. What should I remind you of when things get difficult?"
msgstr "Mejanya sudah siap. Aku juga. Kalau keadaan jadi sulit, kamu mau aku mengingatkanmu tentang apa?"

msgid "Make something I'm proud of"
msgstr "Membuat sesuatu yang kubanggakan"

msgid "Reach someone who needs it"
msgstr "Menjangkau orang yang membutuhkannya"

msgid "The first page worth keeping"
msgstr "Halaman pertama yang layak disimpan"

msgid "I kept a copy of the first finished page. Official archival duties, obviously."
msgstr "Aku menyimpan salinan halaman pertama yang selesai. Tugas arsip resmi, tentu saja."

msgid "Keep the rough draft too"
msgstr "Simpan juga drafnya"

msgid "Start with the finished page"
msgstr "Mulai dari halaman yang sudah jadi"

msgid "Same clipboard, different day"
msgstr "Papan klip yang sama, hari yang berbeda"

msgid "The clipboard has room for a difficult chapter, too. What would help right now?"
msgstr "Papan klipnya juga masih punya ruang untuk bab yang sulit. Apa yang bisa membantu sekarang?"

msgid "Talk it through"
msgstr "Membicarakannya"

msgid "Just stay beside me for a bit"
msgstr "Temani aku sebentar saja"

msgid "Tea beside the draft"
msgstr "Teh di samping draf"

msgid "A pause is allowed. I checked. I'll stay beside you. We don't have to fill the silence."
msgstr "Istirahat sebentar itu boleh. Aku sudah memeriksanya. Aku akan tetap di sampingmu. Kita tidak perlu mengisi keheningan."

msgid "Stay and chat"
msgstr "Tetap di sini dan mengobrol"

msgid "Enjoy the quiet"
msgstr "Menikmati ketenangan"

msgid "Desk migration"
msgstr "Pindahan meja"

msgid "The important equipment survived. Clipboard, glasses, and an unreasonable amount of hair."
msgstr "Peralatan penting selamat. Papan klip, kacamata, dan rambut yang jumlahnya tidak masuk akal."

msgid "How is the archive?"
msgstr "Bagaimana arsipnya?"

msgid "How is the new view?"
msgstr "Bagaimana pemandangan barunya?"

msgid "Part of manga history"
msgstr "Bagian dari sejarah manga"

msgid "Anime, merchandise, a million readers. People will remember these pages. I kept the first one, you know."
msgstr "Anime, merchandise, sejuta pembaca. Orang-orang akan mengingat halaman-halaman ini. Yang pertama aku simpan, lho."

msgid "Let's keep making them"
msgstr "Ayo terus membuatnya"

msgid "Thank you for staying"
msgstr "Terima kasih sudah tetap di sini"
